    "hypothesis": "Dimensionless ratios of baryonic dynamical, stellar mass-doubling, collisionless relaxation, and cosmic timescales contain held-out information about resolved outer-to-inner stellar velocity-span ratios beyond the underlying mass, size, star-formation, age-proxy, morphology, and redshift variables, and the selected ratio transfers without candidate reselection to H-alpha.",
