    "interpretation_boundary": "The response is a resolved annular line-of-sight span ratio, not deprojected circular speed. Algebraic multiples of sqrt(R^3/GM) are one equivalence class. Stellar mass-doubling time uses catalog specific SFR; two-body relaxation is a classical collisionless null; neither is a direct hot-gas cooling time or causal gravitational field equation."
  },
